#. TRANSLATORS: what the R* flag (Red Team) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"If it's yours, prevent other teams from taking it. If it's not take it to "
"your base to capture it!"
msgstr ""
"Om den är din, hindra andra lag från att ta den. Om inte, ta den till din "
"bas för att erövra den!"

#. TRANSLATORS: what the F flag (Rapid Fire) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Shoots more often.  Shells go faster but not as far."
msgstr "Skjuter oftare. Granaterna går snabbare men inte lika långt."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the MG flag (Machine Gun) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Very fast reload and very short range."
msgstr "Mycket snabb omladdning och mycket kort räckvidd."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the GM flag (Guided Missile) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"Shots track a target.  Lock on with right button.  Can lock on or retarget "
"after firing."
msgstr ""
"Skotten följer ett mål. Lås med höger knapp. Kan låsa eller byta mål efter "
"avfyrning."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the L flag (Laser) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Shoots a laser.  Infinite speed and range but long reload time."
msgstr ""
"Skjuter en laser. Oändlig hastighet och räckvidd men lång omladdningstid."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the R flag (Ricochet) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Shots bounce off walls.  Don't shoot yourself!"
msgstr "Skotten studsar mot väggar. Skjut inte dig själv!"

#. TRANSLATORS: what the SB flag (Super Bullet) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Shoots through buildings.  Can kill Phantom Zone."
msgstr "Skjuter genom byggnader. Kan döda stridsvagnar i fantomzonen."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the IB flag (Invisible Bullet) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"Your shots don't appear on other radars.  Can still see them out window."
msgstr ""
"Dina skott syns inte på andras radar. De syns fortfarande genom fönstret."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the SW flag (Shock Wave) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"Firing destroys all tanks nearby.  Don't kill teammates!  Can kill tanks on/"
"in buildings."
msgstr ""
"Avfyrning förstör alla stridsvagnar i närheten. Döda inte lagkamrater! "
"Träffar även stridsvagnar på/i byggnader."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the SH flag (Shield) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Getting hit only drops flag.  Flag flies an extra-long time."
msgstr "En träff tappar bara flaggan. Flaggan flyger extra länge."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the V flag (High Speed) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank moves faster.  Outrun bad guys."
msgstr "Stridsvagnen kör snabbare. Spring ifrån skurkarna."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the QT flag (Quick Turn) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank turns faster.  Good for dodging."
msgstr "Stridsvagnen svänger snabbare. Bra för att undvika skott."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the OO flag (Oscillation Overthruster) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Can drive through buildings.  Can't back up or shoot while inside."
msgstr "Kan köra genom byggnader. Kan inte backa eller skjuta inuti dem."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the BU flag (Burrow) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"Tank burrows underground, impervious to normal shots, but can be steamrolled "
"by anyone!"
msgstr ""
"Stridsvagnen gräver ner sig, immun mot vanliga skott, men vem som helst kan "
"köra över den!"

#. TRANSLATORS: what the PZ flag (Phantom Zone) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"Teleporting toggles Zoned effect.  Zoned tank can drive through buildings.  "
"Zoned tank shoots Zoned bullets and can't be shot (except by superbullet, "
"shock wave, and other Zoned tanks)."
msgstr ""
"Teleportering slår på eller av zoneffekten. En stridsvagn i zonen kan köra "
"genom byggnader. Den skjuter zonskott och kan inte träffas (utom av "
"superkula, chockvåg och andra stridsvagnar i zonen)."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the A flag (Agility) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank is quick and nimble making it easier to dodge."
msgstr "Stridsvagnen är snabb och vig, så det är lättare att undvika skott."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the SR flag (Steamroller) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Destroys tanks you touch but you have to get really close."
msgstr "Förstör stridsvagnar du rör vid, men du måste komma riktigt nära."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the G flag (Genocide) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Killing one tank kills that tank's whole team."
msgstr "Dödar du en stridsvagn dödar du hela dess lag."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the JP flag (Jumping) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank can jump.  Use Tab key.  Can't steer in the air."
msgstr ""
"Stridsvagnen kan hoppa. Använd Tab-tangenten. Går inte att styra i luften."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the ID flag (Identify) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Identifies type of nearest flag."
msgstr "Identifierar typen av närmaste flagga."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the US flag (Useless) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "You have found the useless flag. Use it wisely."
msgstr "Du har hittat den oanvändbara flaggan. Använd den klokt."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the WG flag (Wings) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank can drive in air."
msgstr "Stridsvagnen kan köra i luften."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the T flag (Tiny) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank is small and can get through small openings.  Very hard to hit."
msgstr ""
"Stridsvagnen är liten och tar sig genom små öppningar. Mycket svår att "
"träffa."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the N flag (Narrow) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"Tank is super thin.  Very hard to hit from front but is normal size from "
"side.  Can get through small openings."
msgstr ""
"Stridsvagnen är supertunn. Mycket svår att träffa framifrån men normalstor "
"från sidan. Tar sig genom små öppningar."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the RC flag (ReverseControls) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank driving controls are reversed."
msgstr "Stridsvagnens styrning är omvänd."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the FO flag (Forward Only) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Can't drive in reverse."
msgstr "Kan inte backa."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the RO flag (ReverseOnly) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Can't drive forward."
msgstr "Kan inte köra framåt."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the LT flag (Left Turn Only) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Can't turn right."
msgstr "Kan inte svänga höger."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the RT flag (Right Turn Only) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Can't turn left."
msgstr "Kan inte svänga vänster."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the BY flag (Bouncy) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank can't stop bouncing."
msgstr "Stridsvagnen kan inte sluta studsa."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the TR flag (Trigger Happy) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank can't stop firing."
msgstr "Stridsvagnen kan inte sluta skjuta."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the M flag (Momentum) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank has inertia.  Acceleration is limited."
msgstr "Stridsvagnen är trög. Accelerationen är begränsad."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the NJ flag (No Jumping) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank can't jump."
msgstr "Stridsvagnen kan inte hoppa."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the O flag (Obesity) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Tank becomes very large.  Can't fit through teleporters."
msgstr "Stridsvagnen blir mycket stor. Får inte plats genom teleportrar."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the CB flag (Colorblindness) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Can't tell team colors.  Don't shoot teammates!"
msgstr "Kan inte skilja lagfärger åt. Skjut inte lagkamrater!"

#. TRANSLATORS: what the B flag (Blindness) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Can't see out window.  Radar still works."
msgstr "Kan inte se genom fönstret. Radarn fungerar fortfarande."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the ST flag (Stealth) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"Tank is invisible on radar.  Shots are still visible.  Sneak up behind "
"enemies!"
msgstr ""
"Stridsvagnen är osynlig på radarn. Skotten syns fortfarande. Smyg dig på "
"fiender bakifrån!"

#. TRANSLATORS: what the CL flag (Cloaking) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"Tank is invisible out window.  Shots are still visible.  Sneak up behind "
"enemies!"
msgstr ""
"Stridsvagnen är osynlig genom fönstret. Skotten syns fortfarande. Smyg dig "
"på fiender bakifrån!"

#. TRANSLATORS: what the MQ flag (Masquerade) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "In opponent's hud, you appear as a teammate."
msgstr "I motståndarens HUD ser du ut som en lagkamrat."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the SE flag (Seer) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "See stealthed, cloaked and masquerading tanks as normal."
msgstr "Ser radarosynliga, osynliga och maskerade stridsvagnar som vanligt."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the TH flag (Thief) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Steal flags.  Small and fast but can't kill."
msgstr "Stjäl flaggor. Liten och snabb men kan inte döda."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the JM flag (Jamming) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid "Radar doesn't work.  Can still see."
msgstr "Radarn fungerar inte. Kan fortfarande se."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the WA flag (Wide Angle) does
#: public/js/flags.mjs public/js/teams.mjs
msgid ""
"Fish-eye lens distorts view.  bzo leaves the view alone, so this one only "
"costs you the time to shake it off."
msgstr ""
"En fisheyelins förvränger sikten. bzo låter sikten vara, så den här kostar "
"dig bara tiden det tar att bli av med den."

